airo to attend the Annual Meeting on November 12, 2024 \\u2014 the hospital where he completed most of his basic training. He gave a presentation on shoulder surgery and reconnected with longtime colleagues and friends in a setting full of memories and professional exchange. This visit marked a meaningful moment in his journey and reinforced the importance of lifelong learning and sharing expertise.\",\"date\":\"November 29, 2024\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":30.0444,\"lng\":31.235700000000001,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"AO Trauma Advanced Course\",\"location\":\"Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh took part in the AO Trauma Advanced Course in Dubai \\u2014 a three-day intensive program focused on trauma surgery and surgical education. He taught alongside outstanding colleagues, gaining new insights while sharing his expertise with participants. This experience underscored the value of continuous medical education and the power of knowledge exchange in elevating patient care across the field of orthopaedics.\",\"date\":\"November 1, 2024\",\"type\":\"courses\",\"role\":\"Faculty Instructor\",\"lat\":25.276900000000001,\"lng\":55.296199999999999,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Advanced Shoulder Surgery Course\",\"location\":\"Ghent, Belgium \",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated in an advanced shoulder surgery course in the city of Ghent, Belgium, featuring cadaver-based training and hands-on surgical techniques. The weekend was filled with valuable teaching moments, reconnecting with old friends, and building new professional relationships. Special thanks to the Conmed Team for their outstanding organization and commitment to medical education.\",\"date\":\"November 28, 2024\",\"type\":\"courses\",\"role\":\"Chairman & Speaker\",\"lat\":51.0259,\"lng\":3.7094999999999998,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"ESSKA Meeting\",\"location\":\"Milan, Italy\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh attended the ESSKA Meeting in Milan, Italy, where he delivered a presentation on shoulder surgery and sports medicine. The weekend was filled with enriching discussions, reconnecting with friends, and spending quality time with mentors who have shaped his professional journey. This event reflects his ongoing dedication to advancing orthopaedic knowledge and fostering global collaboration.\",\"date\":\"November 15, 2024\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":45.465400000000002,\"lng\":9.1859000000000002,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Teaching Workshop at Acibadem University\",\"location\":\"Istanbul, T\\u00fcrkiye\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh spent a productive weekend at Acibadem University in Istanbul, teaching shoulder and knee arthroscopy techniques. The workshop focused on skill enhancement and improving patient outcomes through hands-on surgical education. Special thanks to Smith & Nephew for their continued support in empowering surgeons and advancing medical care.\",\"date\":\"November 29, 2024\",\"type\":\"workshops\",\"role\":\"Faculty Instructor\",\"lat\":41.008200000000002,\"lng\":28.978400000000001,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"International Trauma Congress ITC\",\"location\":\"Istanbul, T\\u00fcrkiye\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated in the International Trauma Congress (ITC 2024), a three-day event featuring high-level scientific sessions and cadaver-based workshops. The congress focused on the latest advancements in trauma surgery and provided a dynamic platform for skill development and professional exchange.\",\"date\":\"November 8, 2024\",\"type\":\"workshops\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":41.008200000000002,\"lng\":28.978400000000001,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Arab Health Exhibition 2024\",\"location\":\"Dubai World Trade Centre\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh took part in Arab Health 2024, the largest healthcare exhibition in the region, held in the vibrant city of Dubai. The event brought together brilliant minds and showcased