ription\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated in the International Congress on Shoulder and Elbow Surgery, held in Rome over four days. He delivered two scientific lectures and chaired one session as part of the official program. The congress gathered leading experts in shoulder and elbow surgery for advanced discussions, lectures, and workshops.\",\"date\":\"May 3, 2023\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":41.902799999999999,\"lng\":12.4964,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"11th International Annual Congress of the Egyptian Arthroscopy Association\",\"location\":\"Cairo, Egypt\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated as an invited speaker in the 11th International Annual Congress of the Egyptian Arthroscopy Association, held in Cairo. His contribution included delivering a scientific lecture as part of the official program, alongside a distinguished group of experts in arthroscopic surgery.\",\"date\":\"January 3, 2023\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":30.0444,\"lng\":31.235700000000001,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"International Knee Arthroscopy Training \\u2013 Ghent University\",\"location\":\"Ghent, Belgium\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated as an instructor in an international training program on knee arthroscopy, held at Ghent University in Belgium. The program brought together orthopedic surgeons from Europe, Africa, and the Middle East for hands-on training and academic exchange. Dr. Saleh contributed by teaching advanced arthroscopic techniques and engaging in collaborative learning with colleagues from diverse regions. The event was supported by ConMed, aiming to enhance surgical outcomes and patient care.\",\"date\":\"January 1, 2023\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Instructor & Speaker\",\"lat\":51.0259,\"lng\":3.7094999999999998,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Basic AOTrauma Course\",\"location\":\"Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"Dr. Osama Hassan Saleh participated in a 3-day Basic AOTrauma course he