y members to plan upcoming AO Trauma educational courses, exchange insights, and enhance collaboration across training programs. Dr. Saleh\\u2019s involvement reflects his leadership in orthopedic education and his commitment to advancing trauma surgery standards across the region.\",\"date\":\"March 5, 2022\",\"type\":\"workshops\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":41.008200000000002,\"lng\":28.978400000000001,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Emirates International Orthopaedic Congress\",\"location\":\"Dubai, M\\u00f6venpick Grand Hotel Al Bustan\",\"description\":\"Dr. Osama Saleh was featured among the distinguished participants at the 9th Emirates International Orthopaedic Congress, held at the M\\u00f6venpick Grand Hotel Al Bustan in Dubai. The congress brought together over 600 orthopedic professionals from across the region to discuss the latest innovations in joint reconstruction, arthroscopy, trauma surgery, and sports medicine. Dr. Saleh\\u2019s presence reflects his active engagement in regional orthopedic education and his contribution to advancing surgical practices in the Middle East\",\"date\":\"November 4, 2021\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":25.119399999999999,\"lng\":55.377499999999998,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Basic Principles of Fracture Management\",\"location\":\"Dubai, M\\u00f6venpick Grand Al Bustan Hotel\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated in the AO Trauma educational course held at M\\u00f6venpick Grand Al Bustan Hotel \\u2013 Dubai, alongside Dr. Saeed Althani and a distinguished group of orthopaedic surgeons. The three-day program featured intensive training sessions, scientific chairing, and professional networking in a dynamic and collegial atmosphere. Dr. Saleh\\u2019s involvement reflects his ongoing commitment to surgical education and his active role in initiatives that enhance orthopaedic care across the region.\",\"date\":\"August 9, 2021\",\"type\":\"courses\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":25.119399999999999,\"lng\":55.377499999999998,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Short Educational Program\",\"location\":\"Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"participated in a two-day educational gathering in Dubai, featuring interactive teaching sessions and collegial networking with fellow orthopaedic surgeons. The event offered a refreshing blend of learning and friendship, rekindling the spirit of in-person meetings that many professionals have missed in recent years. Dr. Saleh\\u2019s presence reflects his ongoing commitment to both surgical education and the human connections that enrich the medical community.\",\"date\":\"October 6, 2021\",\"type\":\"workshops\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":25.276986999999998,\"lng\":55.296249000000003,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"AO Trauma Advanced Principles of Fracture Management Course\",\"location\":\"Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh served as faculty in the AO Trauma Advanced Principles of Fracture Management course held in Dubai from December 4-6, 2020. The intensive three-day program focused on advanced trauma surgery techniques, delivered in a hybrid format combining in-person training with digital learning components. Dr. Saleh's participation as faculty member demonstrated his expertise in orthopedic trauma and commitment to surgical education at both regional and international levels. The course featured hands-on training and advanced clinical discussions for trauma specialists.\",\"date\":\"December 4, 2020\",\"type\":\"courses\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":25.276986999999998,\"lng\":55.296249000000003,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"MiTek Educational Visit\",\"location\":\"Norderstedt, Germany\",\"description\":\"Dr. Usama Hassan Saleh participated in a professional visit and educational exchange at Johnson & Johnson Medical GmbH \\u2013 Ethicon Deutschland, located in Norderstedt, Germany. The event, organized by MiTek, brought together orthopaedic professionals for hands-on training and collaborative learning. Dr. Saleh\\u2019s participation reflected his ongoing commitment to surgical education and his appreciation for reconnecting with both new and long-standing colleagues.\",\"date\":\"January 1, 2019\",\"type\":\"workshops\",\"role\":\"Speaker\",\"lat\":53.706499999999998,\"lng\":9.9877000000000002,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"11 TH INTERNATIONAL ARTHROSCOPY ACADEMY MEETING 2025\",\"location\":\"Westin Powai, Mumbai\",\"description\":\"As we step into 2025, a landmark year for arthroscopy and sports medicine, we celebrate\\r\\nnot just the evolution of cutting-edge techniques but also 11 years of excellence, collaboration,\\r\\nand innovation. Over the past decade, this platform has witnessed pioneering surgical\\r\\nadvancements, the integration of AI in diagnostics, breakthroughs in regenerative medicine,\\r\\nand the rise of minimally invasive solutions that have redefined patient care. Now, in 2025,\\r\\nwe stand at the crossroads of the future, where technology, precision, and expertise will\\r\\nshape the next era of sports medicine.\",\"date\":\"June 19, 2025\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Moderator & Speaker\",\"lat\":19.134857359112296,\"lng\":72.901402224206478,\"url\":\"http:\\\/\\\/www.arthroscopyacademy.in\\\/\"},{\"title\":\"12th International Congress for Joint Reconstruction, Middle East (ICJR ME)\",\"location\":\"Jumeirah Emirates Towers Hotel Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"talked about Young arthritic shoulder\",\"date\":\"April 25, 2025\",\"type\":\"events\",\"role\":\"Moderator & Speaker\",\"lat\":25.183278159256119,\"lng\":55.242877124397857,\"url\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"4th Complex Joint Management Conference &#038; Exhibition\",\"location\":\"Holiday Inn, Dubai Festival City Dubai, UAE\",\"description\":\"- Get latest tech & procedure updates\\r\\n\\r\\n- Network with global orthopaedic experts\\r\\n\\r\\n- Explore cutting-edge clinical products\\r\\n\\r\\n- Learn about emerging specialty fields\\r\\n\\r\\n- Master fundamentals to advanced practices\",\"d